- bwp — open a window in one of your Brave profiles (⌘ with the current tab)
- bwt — switch to an open tab (⌘ copy URL, ⇧⌘ Markdown, ⌥ edit URL, ⌃ close tabs with this URL)
- bhi — search the history of every profile (⌘ copy URL, ⇧⌘ Markdown, ⌥ edit URL)
- bwc — copy the current tab URL (⇧⌘ Markdown)
- btp — reopen the current tab in a private window (⌘ also close it)

The first use asks macOS to let Alfred control Brave Browser (Automation permission).</string>
